					{"key": "water", "at": Vector2(298.2, 155.4), "name": "the black water", "text": "The nave is flooded to the height of a man's knee, flat as a plate, and the candle's light lies on it in a long straight road. Halfway down the road the light stops, as if against a wall, though the water goes on."},
					{"key": "rope", "at": Vector2(300.0, 156.0), "name": "a bell-rope in the dark", "text": "A rope hangs from the vault, far down the nave, swaying very slightly. No wind. It is too thick for a hand. It has been polished to a sheen at the height of a boy's reach, and again, higher, at the height of a woman's."},
